# substrate-kit regenerates this at every session boot and its own header says
# "untracked by design — read it, never commit or edit it". Without this line it
# is untracked-but-not-ignored, so every session-end git check flags it as work
# left uncommitted (2026-08-05).
HANDOFF.md
